Package: com.551.glowiconposition
Name: GlowIconPosition
Version: 1.1.6
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Moves all Glow notification icons up or down together from Settings. The tweak's default position places the icon row just below the notch. Includes an enable switch, vertical position slider, move up/down controls and reset.
Maintainer: 551
Author: 551
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
Homepage: https://github.com/551UK/GlowCompanion
Tag: role::enduser
